(   - Radial acceleration a_r = r_ddot - r * \(theta_dot\)^2:) Tj
T*
(   a_r = 0 - 10.0 * \(0.40\)^2 = - 10.0 * 0.16 = - 1.60 m/s^2 \(directed radially inward\).) Tj
T*
(   - Transverse acceleration a_theta = r * theta_ddot + 2 * r_dot * theta_dot:) Tj
T*
(   a_theta = 0 + 2 * \(1.50\) * \(0.40\) = 1.20 m/s^2 \(Coriolis acceleration contribution\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Total Acceleration Magnitude:) Tj
T*
(   a = sqrt\( a_r^2 + a_theta^2 \) = sqrt\( \(- 1.60\)^2 + \(1.20\)^2 \) = sqrt\( 2.56 + 1.44 \) = sqrt\() Tj
T*
(   4.00 \) = 2.00 m/s^2.) Tj
T*
(   Direction angle beta with radial vector: tan\(beta\) = a_theta / |a_r| = 1.20 / 1.60 = 0.75 =>) Tj
T*
(   beta = 36.87 degrees.) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion: Velocity v = 4.27 m/s; Acceleration a = 2.00 m/s^2.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
