T*
(   4. Integration Over Burn Duration:) Tj
T*
(   Integrating from initial launch mass m0 to burnout mass m_f:) Tj
T*
(   Integral_v0^v dv = - u_e * Integral_m0^mf \(dm / m\) = - u_e * [ ln\(mf\) - ln\(m0\) ].) Tj
T*
(   v - v0 = u_e * ln\( m0 / mf \).) Tj
T*
(   Tsiolkovsky's Rocket Equation: Delta v = u_e * ln\( m0 / mf \).) Tj
T*
(   This fundamental result demonstrates that velocity gain depends logarithmically on mass ratio) Tj
